    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a great start, thanks. I'm also getting a lot of pushback from some older residents in the neighborhood who are worried about \"losing the character of the area\" and increased traffic. How should I address those concerns in my presentation without making it sound like they're just being difficult or old-fashioned?",
